e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F_iQeKdhRt0Q7kNvwGDzsmJ&_nc_oc=Adr63zGJ_QVraArf7px4REErZMoxub7glV2J_VrWzg2NXaJt_p2tHY_1_i_igFzYmu4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAZZ_sHaY0gZDA2pNIJrvzbC9IC3HMUQCWHWpeUkSWNRg&oe=6A58F3F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kEc0H7QPu-cQ7kNvwFxjF9J&_nc_oc=Adop2sFWYx8SYJiE48ZUCsj-wewKc5iCPkEaO5KNjCCuvS6OGYYKI0T0e9Zcr5iq4gA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCSxKmkKIgycciDqhmcQWbtDqoV_Oktqwbt7KjdXRqphA&oe=6A58CB53"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIona-hL1hoQ7kNvwEPEsLM&_nc_oc=Adpo698VM757GyajboUIWHZIaU-bwCNetLQb4fZX3qmgr2OlwgURbLxTs5gmsLCZpLw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBZGgnpJGl_l-tBulw9s-BRJqnH59fk9FUvN0egtdMAtA&oe=6A58D6FB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6PM-GbMxJ0MQ7kNvwGRvjcp&_nc_oc=AdplHDDuP9Wm0aiyorSq9WncOQHvZ6wL35-o1ugAbJQg_Q_AugK8UCr_Aw8s5SPC3T0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDeJvrcbbTTPN1EnPj2uwrx93Q-slsX8gpBevfl_r64Iw&oe=6A58D84A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qslGsU_fiGAQ7kNvwG5TLcS&_nc_oc=Adqtz1pUI8QZHoBt84VpEINvUH_nkiB9-_rveKITn-qaapZiV6pCFx5y3LixYRenKQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDic37sZtWOvYlPO8SXiY9mq5ttFi1qBMZE28h-ee5UyA&oe=6A58F9BE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se